Upload only material you have the right to use.
- Your own product photos, packaging and logos, or ones you have permission for.
- A person who can be recognised must have agreed to appear. Do not upload photos of other people (including children) without their consent.
- You are responsible for what you upload.
Do not upload, or ask us to make:
- sexual or adult content;
- content that is violent, hateful, or harasses or threatens people;
- content that copies or pretends to be another person or brand, or that is meant to deceive (fake reviews, fake endorsements, fake medical or financial claims);
- content that breaks another person’s rights (copyright, trademark, privacy, likeness);
- anything illegal, or about products the platforms ban in ads;
- ads for weapons, tobacco or nicotine, drugs, prescription medicine or health claims without proof, gambling, or adult content.
You must be 18 or older to use the service.
